    "Condition : 1 - The proposed facility would continue to fall within the restricted uses permitted under the Community Facility Strategy (dated October 2016), in line with the previously approved details of the Section 106 agreement (dated 19/03/2014) between The London Borough of Wandsworth and Viridian Development Services Limited. ",
